%% UI owners: packages/message/src/lib/services/messageDialog.service.ts:1；packages/message/src/lib/components/confirm-window/create-chat/create-chat.component.ts:1；packages/message/src/lib/components/windows/choose-session/choose-session.component.ts:1；src/app/message-host/runtime/im-gate/helix/helixTauriImGate.service.ts:1（实际命令与关联回灌）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员登录 / 切公司后，左侧会话列表从当前账号的本地快照一次恢复，旧账号会话不会混入、读取动作不会清未读，本次查询也不启动远端补偿
  Note over UI,Web: 合同登记快照（不等于当前实现或实测）：mock=partial；helix=partial；dual=yes；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: queryDialogList(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_query_dialog_list", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_query_dialog_list", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_query_dialog_list", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 登录/切公司后拉取全部可见会话 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Scan（channel/event_seq + sync cursor）
  Host->>DB: account-scoped read or write
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(local result)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(local)
  E->>IM: correlate local result
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit im:read:result（请求关联结果）
  Sink-->>Gate: im:__bus__ 按 req_id 或 requestId 结算等待者
  Gate-->>UI: render absolute snapshot or query result
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：同一 queryDialogList 只返回一次结构化 Command Result  items ，items 是当前账号库中按 is_top、last_post_at、created_at 降序读取的可见频道绝对快照；ImGate events$ 始终为空；rawDialogs 由 mediator.apply() 写入（禁止裸赋值），保护 4 个字段 + 7 个 ApplyReason + messagesLoaded 单调性；Angular 只解包 Result.items；rootId 非空的话题允许存在于结果中，但只能由既有树形视图挂到父频道，不能成为主会话根节点；各频道 unreadCount 取快照携带值，本 Gate 只读不写：装载动作绝不把自侧未读归零；归零只能由显式 G06a / G06b 已读意图触发，setActiveChannel 不具备已读语义
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：queryDialogList 不得发布 channelIncrement、channelsLoaded 或其它 ImGateEvent；现有 Mock 的两类 emit 与 Helix 的 im:channel:list / im:read:channel 只能记作 current/missing 迁移事实，不得复制进新 Adapter 充当目标链；话题频道（type=”T” / rootId 非空）不得成为主会话根节点，只能由既有视图树挂到当前结果内可见的父频道；rawDialogs 不得裸赋值：写入必须经 mediator.apply()（保护 4 字段 + 7 个 ApplyReason + messagesLoaded 单调性），绕过即视为契约破损
  Note over E,Sink: 结果出口：im:read:result；读结果与业务广播区分，不能把无广播理解为无 Effect::Emit
